{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10562","headline":"宝林寺作 · 徐浩","name":"宝林寺作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹山昔飞来，远自琅琊台。\n孤岫龟形在，深泉鳗井开。\n越王屡登陟，何相传词才。\n塔庙宗其巅，规模称壮哉。\n禅堂清溽润，高阁无恢炱。\n照耀珠吐月，铿轰钟隐雷。\n揆余久缨弁，末路遭邅回。\n一弃沧海曲，六年稽岭隈。\n逝川惜东驶，驰景怜西颓。\n腰带愁疾减，容颜衰悴催。\n赖居兹寺中，法士多瓌能。\n洗心听经论，礼足蠲凶灾。\n永愿依胜侣，清江乘度杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}